  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "News updates has come and go. As well news VRChat Home has publiced what many people have fallen love with, but there is always people who want to change the look and design of they home world. We already have old Home kit what many people has used and maked amazing home worlds from it so why cant we keep doing this tradition. \n\nWhat Im requesting? VRChat Home Kit Update to Give us option to design our homes the way we want it. Giving us 2 chooses to use old Home kit or new Home Kit.\n\nUsing the old Post: \"So i wish that the VR-Home is provided as download, so everyone can create their own VR-Home.\"",
